{
  "videoId": "NRbdymYpL9s",
  "title": "Simple Derivation",
  "youtubeUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NRbdymYpL9s",
  "duration": 76.0,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg-0",
      "text": "Hi, so today I just wanted to showcase the derivation of something.",
      "start": 1.9,
      "end": 5.4
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-1",
      "text": "I'm not going to narrate the math, I'll just showcase the step one by one on my screen.",
      "start": 8.2,
      "end": 12.6
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-2",
      "text": "And, yeah, let's go ahead.",
      "start": 12.6,
      "end": 17.4
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-3",
      "text": "So this is the equation $ax^2 + bx + c = 0$ we're looking at.",
      "start": 17.4,
      "end": 19.3
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-4",
      "text": "And step one, we're going to isolate the $x$ terms.",
      "start": 19.3,
      "end": 22.8
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-5",
      "text": "So that's what I do $ax^2 + bx = -c$.",
      "start": 22.8,
      "end": 25.4
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-6",
      "text": "And then we're going to divide through $x^2 + \\left(\\frac{b}{a}\\right)x = -\\frac{c}{a}$.",
      "start": 28.7,
      "end": 30.7
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-7",
      "text": "The next step is to complete the square $x^2 + \\left(\\frac{b}{a}\\right)x + \\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 = -\\frac{c}{a} + \\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2$.",
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 38.4
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-8",
      "text": "And the step after that is factoring the left side $\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 = \\frac{b^2 - 4ac}{4a^2}$.",
      "start": 45.6,
      "end": 48.6
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-9",
      "text": "It factors nicely. And now we take the square root of both sides $x + \\frac{b}{2a} = \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$.",
      "start": 54.3,
      "end": 57.4
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-10",
      "text": "And then we isolate the $x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$.",
      "start": 64.5,
      "end": 66.5
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-11",
      "text": "Yeah, hopefully you enjoyed.",
      "start": 71.5,
      "end": 73.5
    }
  ],
